<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: DCC says ups stake in Broderick Holdings Ltd.</title>
<headline>DCC says ups stake in Broderick Holdings Ltd.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>DCC Plc said on Friday it had bought an additional 7.5 percent shareholding in Broderick Holdings Ltd, the food equipment and catering distribution group, for 107,000 punts.</p>
<p>This brings DCC's shareholding in Broderick to 82.5 percent, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
</text>
